  "what_this_is": "Record of the aixm511 fixtures: SHA-256 and byte count of every fixture file, written 2026-09-21 by adapter-expansion phase 4. The normative schema closure itself is held OUTSIDE the repository (normative_binding `aixm511`, xsd_pin.json there; decision D2) and is not mirrored here. Extended 2026-09-21 by phase 5 with the Digital NOTAM set under dnotam/ (harness documents and twins, cases/, counterexamples/, spec/build_fixtures.py); the Event schema closure is the `dnotam` normative binding, outside the repository.",
